<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Light to issue 15 bln yen covertible.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Light to issue 15 bln yen covertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Sumitomo Light Metal Industries Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Banca del Gottardo</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO		AMT   15 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON No coupon     ISSU PRICE	    MATURITY 31.Jan.01</p>
<p> CONV PRICE 257 yen   CURR RATE</p>
